  "description": "Eight cyan crosses and twenty straight cyan barriers divide red corner brackets, stepped fields and small square hazards. Six yellow bouncers begin at the upper-center, paired upper-right, paired lower-left and lower-right positions. Two cyan patrols start on the top rail and one on the left rail. Start at bottom center, weave between the walls, and reconnect to the safe perimeter to reveal 75%. Red terrain is lethal until captured; cyan walls block movement.",
